      "text": "[Evidence] POST /api/v1/viewer/reading-start (최초 1페이지 열람 트랜잭션)\nUPDATE ebook_entitlements\n   SET reading_started_at = COALESCE(reading_started_at, NOW()),\n       first_read_ip = '211.36.xxx.xxx', first_read_device_id = $1\n WHERE order_id = $2 AND status = 'ACTIVE'; -- 단방향(One-Way) 영구 기록",
